"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EFS9kR86xisQ7kNvwGEpCT2&_nc_oc=AdoevAazPhGBlPC0CEyQ0NVwy1aBJVt4WUetCOI8ro1nfaMX7uPj0_GsnqG_tp1HvgA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI36KnIArpb5jotshTOuwXawvi-OCE0CL6ey50Onl-9NA&oe=6ABA6BA0"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EmVcVaZoQxwQ7kNvwFxaILo&_nc_oc=Adr1RFI3eakr6L33utfbVcBqj6gbddLrAtJHNNPH8hWFz7bq1bMyKoF5P4Lk62e-nOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIWlpyivuyaEhezYe_YSu6yuzpS_iovd8JPK4AH8HIdwQ&oe=6ABA7522"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S_bMYPnhNF8Q7kNvwF2cI6o&_nc_oc=AdqkD0m1VE_GZ6Q_yr8z7XOjUy1LlTKmOeGHov37rrXNS1krFYA5jolGew3kShdWuPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI07RHYCwiGH3YxbdXbwfx0OqYsMJSTPO_J83PMB3x7Gg&oe=6ABA63C1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-CCGTJ9o09cQ7kNvwHf2AXO&_nc_oc=AdqS17tjeSu73zeatsOeUsls7EGbUBuu2eODZBAkxyc2O5LLUsGYNf4zd30GP6Ripvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLonoAXWPPS4hGvhrf3vWoYqkZwQ0vVYr5zFuxuHWs_Eg&oe=6ABA8A12"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/terms", "publisher_name": "Nebulytic", "support_website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/support", "website_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/", "category": null, "comfort_rating"